WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:03.560
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.560 --> 00:06.150
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.820 --> 00:10.220
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.920 --> 00:14.930
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.300 --> 00:17.830
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.170 --> 00:21.610
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.360 --> 00:28.580
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.260 --> 00:34.340
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.140 --> 00:37.630
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.630 --> 00:40.240
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.760 --> 00:48.020
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.990 --> 00:51.750
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.810 --> 00:54.650
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.940 --> 00:55.970
♪Let me♪

00:56.160 --> 01:00.240
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.690 --> 01:03.370
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.660 --> 01:06.360
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.530 --> 01:08.000
♪Hands held tight♪

01:08.000 --> 01:12.170
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.530 --> 01:22.780
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.210 --> 01:29.760
=Legend of The Female General=

01:30.789 --> 01:32.039
They're crossing the line,

01:32.570 --> 01:33.960
putting loaches in my shoes.

01:39.800 --> 01:40.840
I'm sorry.

01:40.840 --> 01:41.770
It was an accident.

01:47.479 --> 01:48.870
These candies got dirty.

01:50.360 --> 01:51.200
Put them back.

01:57.200 --> 01:58.160
Don't eat those.

01:58.160 --> 02:00.140
Should I buy you new ones?

02:00.140 --> 02:01.040
No need. Go to class.

02:09.050 --> 02:12.010
=Episode 5=

02:12.920 --> 02:16.360
You dug so much
into his past, but to no avail?

02:16.560 --> 02:17.400
That's right.

02:17.960 --> 02:19.920
Everything matches his military records.

02:20.970 --> 02:23.800
Maybe He Yan really has nothing to do
with He Rufei and Xu Jingfu.

02:25.640 --> 02:26.480
This only proves

02:27.000 --> 02:28.960
those covering for him
are remarkably capable.

02:29.880 --> 02:30.950
Covering for him?

02:30.950 --> 02:32.840
Commander, have you
discovered something?

02:35.640 --> 02:36.520
An unexpected lead.

02:37.480 --> 02:38.880
Have people keep looking.

02:38.880 --> 02:39.720
Yes.

02:41.880 --> 02:44.400
And what's going on
with the delay in provisions?

02:45.360 --> 02:46.960
Yezhou Magistrate Sun Xiangfu

02:46.960 --> 02:48.300
claims the harvest is poor,

02:49.079 --> 02:50.960
the farmers are owed payments,

02:50.960 --> 02:53.000
and the grain reserves
are critically low.

02:53.000 --> 02:54.720
So he can't spare us any grain.

02:56.220 --> 02:57.780
Absolute nonsense.

02:58.260 --> 02:59.570
It's not like there were

02:59.940 --> 03:01.220
any natural disasters.

03:06.780 --> 03:07.780
There were none.

03:08.460 --> 03:09.610
But man-made troubles exist.

03:10.170 --> 03:12.170
I bet Xu Jingfu told him to oppose you.

03:16.940 --> 03:18.940
Xu Jingfu got me transferred to Yezhou,

03:19.430 --> 03:20.610
away from the capital,

03:21.340 --> 03:23.260
without any chance to turn the tide.

03:23.780 --> 03:24.780
He never imagined

03:25.260 --> 03:27.690
that you had already chosen
to bide your time here.

03:28.010 --> 03:28.900
But now that

03:28.900 --> 03:30.380
you've trained these misfits

03:30.380 --> 03:31.820
into capable soldiers,

03:31.940 --> 03:32.780
he's rushing

03:33.410 --> 03:34.690
to tamper with our provisions.

03:35.340 --> 03:36.180
That's right.

03:37.060 --> 03:38.260
The new recruits lack cohesion.

03:39.100 --> 03:40.300
If provisions run short

03:40.980 --> 03:42.090
in times of good harvests

03:42.690 --> 03:44.850
and rumors of embezzlement surface,

03:45.290 --> 03:46.340
the new recruits will

03:47.290 --> 03:48.690
lose their trust in me.

03:49.540 --> 03:50.540
What should we do?

03:51.170 --> 03:53.290
The remaining provisions
can last a bit longer.

03:54.010 --> 03:58.540
After the contest of capturing flags,
I'll visit Sun Xiangfu in person

03:59.850 --> 04:00.690
and find out

04:01.690 --> 04:03.500
what kind of pawn

04:04.170 --> 04:05.900
Xu Jingfu had planted in Yezhou.

04:22.730 --> 04:23.570
(He Yan,)

04:24.780 --> 04:25.810
(those closest to you)

04:26.730 --> 04:27.570
(despised you,)

04:27.980 --> 04:28.820
(abandoned you,)

04:29.170 --> 04:30.010
(and killed you.)

04:31.780 --> 04:33.659
(Since you've come back
with a new identity,)

04:34.659 --> 04:35.540
(from now on,)

04:36.290 --> 04:37.140
(your life)

04:37.980 --> 04:39.810
(will be solely in your hands.)

05:01.290 --> 05:02.130
Mr. He.

05:02.700 --> 05:04.680
Your lanterns are hideous.

05:04.680 --> 05:06.460
What matters is the sincerity.

05:12.460 --> 05:13.300
Mr. Cheng.

05:13.580 --> 05:14.460
Isn't your lantern

05:14.980 --> 05:15.930
way too huge?

05:16.700 --> 05:17.540
This lantern

05:18.100 --> 05:19.850
is not just for my ancestors.

05:20.540 --> 05:21.810
It's also for Huaijin.

05:22.210 --> 05:24.020
So I made it bigger than usual.

05:24.700 --> 05:25.900
With both families together,

05:26.170 --> 05:27.010
it's livelier

05:27.250 --> 05:28.090
and less lonely.

05:29.140 --> 05:29.980
My grand-aunt

05:30.370 --> 05:31.370
feared loneliness most.

05:32.930 --> 05:33.850
Madam Xiao

05:34.810 --> 05:35.850
also passed away?

05:36.659 --> 05:37.500
Yeah.

05:37.930 --> 05:39.890
She and my great-uncle
were a loving couple.

05:40.980 --> 05:42.140
After my great-uncle died,

05:42.700 --> 05:43.850
my great-aunt was devastated.

05:44.540 --> 05:45.380
After Huaijin

05:45.610 --> 05:47.540
escorted my great-uncle's coffin home,

05:48.140 --> 05:49.100
she took her own life.

05:56.930 --> 05:58.250
Huaijin is also quite lonely.

05:59.340 --> 06:00.180
My family,

06:00.540 --> 06:01.380
including my mother,

06:01.770 --> 06:03.450
and friends acquainted
with the Xiao family

06:04.020 --> 06:04.980
don't really like him.

06:06.260 --> 06:07.940
They prefer my eldest uncle,

06:08.340 --> 06:09.490
Huaijin's older brother,

06:09.730 --> 06:10.570
Xiao Jing.

06:11.490 --> 06:12.620
Why?

06:12.620 --> 06:14.470
Aren't they both members
of The Xiao family?

06:15.240 --> 06:17.340
The Xiao family comes from
a long military lineage.

06:18.090 --> 06:19.460
One child must join the army.

06:20.050 --> 06:21.780
Xiao Jing is more of a scholar

06:22.330 --> 06:23.330
than a military man.

06:23.850 --> 06:25.010
So Huaijin joined the army

06:25.690 --> 06:26.570
for his elder brother

06:26.890 --> 06:28.090
and the entire family.

06:30.130 --> 06:32.850
He left at an early age
and rarely visited home.

06:33.570 --> 06:35.050
So, he's become quite aloof.

06:35.290 --> 06:37.530
He's distant even with his own family,

06:37.530 --> 06:38.650
let alone relatives like us.

06:39.370 --> 06:40.210
Even his mother

06:40.770 --> 06:42.010
doesn't feel bonded with him.

06:43.170 --> 06:44.010
Makes sense.

06:44.770 --> 06:47.210
They're like strangers
after years apart.

06:47.810 --> 06:49.330
It leads to prejudice.

06:56.370 --> 06:57.640
Mr. He, it's late.

06:57.640 --> 06:58.650
I should head back.

06:59.090 --> 06:59.970
Rest early.

07:41.370 --> 07:42.370
In times of hardship,

07:42.690 --> 07:44.260
take a piece of candy.

07:44.930 --> 07:46.210
Let its sweetness

07:46.210 --> 07:47.090
comfort you.

07:47.530 --> 07:49.010
Such little sweetness

07:49.010 --> 07:50.890
can attenuate the bitterness of life.

08:22.170 --> 08:23.340
Premium Osmanthus wine.

08:23.770 --> 08:26.570
I hear noblewomen
in the capital adore this.

08:38.500 --> 08:39.929
May the deceased

08:39.929 --> 08:40.970
witness my devotion

08:41.010 --> 08:42.370
in folding these lanterns

08:42.370 --> 08:44.250
and bless my wishes.

08:47.770 --> 08:48.930
Disturbing the deceased

08:49.770 --> 08:51.500
doesn't make you ashamed at all.

08:51.970 --> 08:52.810
Leave mortal affairs

08:53.730 --> 08:55.020
to be handled by the living.

08:59.490 --> 09:00.930
How do you know

09:00.930 --> 09:02.410
I'm not speaking

09:02.410 --> 09:03.720
the wishes of the deceased?

09:04.660 --> 09:05.730
The regrets of the dead

09:05.730 --> 09:07.450
must be redeemed by the living.

09:08.280 --> 09:09.770
This is my promise to them.

09:15.050 --> 09:15.890
Want to fold some?

09:18.050 --> 09:19.180
I'll share some with you

09:19.570 --> 09:21.450
to repay you for saving me back then.

09:25.130 --> 09:25.970
No need.

09:33.050 --> 09:34.120
This one

09:34.650 --> 09:36.650
carries blessings
to those heroes who died

09:36.650 --> 09:38.370
defending our land and people,

09:38.650 --> 09:39.650
and their loved ones.

09:41.450 --> 09:42.930
Though I don't know your names,

09:43.570 --> 09:44.690
these blessings

09:44.690 --> 09:46.210
come from my heart.

09:48.290 --> 09:49.130
Not bad.

09:50.570 --> 09:51.610
Hideous.

09:55.010 --> 09:56.930
This is called free-form one.

09:57.170 --> 09:58.010
Perhaps

09:58.290 --> 09:59.570
the heroes prefer it this way.

10:06.170 --> 10:07.610
You mock my lanterns,

10:07.610 --> 10:08.730
but you won't make one.

10:08.970 --> 10:10.530
All talk, no action.

10:10.530 --> 10:11.730
So picky.

10:32.930 --> 10:33.770
What's the fuss?

10:34.450 --> 10:36.090
I touched your hand, so what?

10:37.850 --> 10:40.090
(This woman has no sense of propriety.)

10:42.860 --> 10:44.590
♪Constant yearning♪

10:45.050 --> 10:48.820
♪Still vivid as our first meeting♪

10:50.040 --> 10:52.050
♪Endless gazing♪

10:52.620 --> 10:56.060
♪Step by step, falling deeper♪

10:56.570 --> 10:58.440
♪How to untangle this love♪

10:58.720 --> 11:04.210
♪Buried deep within dreams♪

11:05.390 --> 11:10.630
♪My heart, unyielding as stone,
remains true♪

11:11.890 --> 11:16.010
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

11:16.010 --> 11:18.800
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

11:19.290 --> 11:26.050
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

11:26.140 --> 11:30.570
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

11:30.570 --> 11:34.470
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

11:34.970 --> 11:39.450
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

11:39.450 --> 11:40.330
Done.

11:42.090 --> 11:42.930
It's ready.

11:52.900 --> 11:54.640
♪In the vast world♪

11:55.100 --> 11:58.860
♪I searched for years♪

12:00.340 --> 12:02.200
♪Shadows hustle♪

12:02.680 --> 12:04.970
♪Scenes reappear♪

12:04.970 --> 12:05.810
Hurry up.

12:06.620 --> 12:08.490
♪What is there to fear♪

12:08.760 --> 12:14.260
♪We'll weather storms together♪

12:15.450 --> 12:21.340
♪Through endless dawns and dusks,
to eternity♪

12:21.930 --> 12:26.230
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

12:26.230 --> 12:28.760
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

12:29.300 --> 12:36.090
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

12:36.090 --> 12:40.570
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

12:40.570 --> 12:44.660
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

12:45.020 --> 12:48.330
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

12:48.330 --> 12:49.170
Done.

12:51.620 --> 12:55.750
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

12:55.750 --> 12:58.540
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

12:59.030 --> 13:05.780
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

13:05.780 --> 13:10.310
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

13:10.310 --> 13:14.200
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

13:14.710 --> 13:20.730
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

13:29.100 --> 13:30.700
Under the bright moon,
I long for my kin.

13:30.700 --> 13:32.500
I wonder if the deceased

13:32.500 --> 13:33.890
shares this moonlight

13:34.730 --> 13:36.260
with us, the living?

13:37.290 --> 13:38.130
Yes, they do.

14:13.510 --> 14:14.810
New recruits, listen up!

14:15.340 --> 14:16.460
Red flags are placed

14:16.930 --> 14:18.630
throughout Mount Baiyue.

14:18.630 --> 14:20.060
There are 15 in total.

14:20.690 --> 14:21.720
This competition

14:21.720 --> 14:22.780
lasts until sunset.

14:23.500 --> 14:26.020
The team returning
with the most red flags

14:26.280 --> 14:28.220
shall be the winner.

14:28.740 --> 14:30.580
Remember. Don't cross the mountains.

14:31.140 --> 14:32.220
Don't take lives.

14:32.650 --> 14:33.490
Violators will face

14:33.650 --> 14:34.620
military discipline.

14:34.930 --> 14:35.770
- Yes.
- Yes.

14:37.170 --> 14:38.260
After the competition,

14:38.740 --> 14:40.140
the most outstanding recruit

14:40.460 --> 14:42.530
will join the Nine Banners Battalion.

14:43.100 --> 14:44.410
- Really?
- Really?

14:46.530 --> 14:47.370
Soldiers!

14:47.980 --> 14:48.820
Set out.

14:49.810 --> 14:50.650
- Yes.
- Yes.

14:59.270 --> 15:00.810
This is the map of Mount Baiyue?

15:01.380 --> 15:02.220
Where did you get it?

15:05.020 --> 15:06.770
I memorized the paths while patrolling

15:06.770 --> 15:08.580
and drew this map after I came back.

15:08.580 --> 15:11.500
You memorized the paths

15:11.740 --> 15:13.290
while being chased by wolves?

15:13.290 --> 15:14.570
I checked the routes

15:14.570 --> 15:15.620
while fleeing,

15:15.620 --> 15:17.000
and then reviewed them later.

15:17.000 --> 15:18.060
So I know this place well.

15:19.020 --> 15:20.380
Trust your boss.

15:22.760 --> 15:23.820
Those flags

15:24.220 --> 15:26.340
are usually placed in visible areas

15:26.620 --> 15:27.980
near foothills and water sources.

15:28.660 --> 15:30.530
So the nearest flag

15:31.290 --> 15:32.360
should be

15:32.360 --> 15:33.930
on this open mountainside.

15:34.810 --> 15:36.040
Come on, let's go for it.

15:36.770 --> 15:37.610
No.

15:37.690 --> 15:38.890
We're not going there.

15:40.070 --> 15:41.290
Those flags in the open

15:41.290 --> 15:43.210
are easy targets.

15:43.210 --> 15:44.860
Many teams will notice them.

15:45.530 --> 15:46.630
If we go there,

15:47.050 --> 15:48.340
we'll be caught in chaos.

15:49.290 --> 15:50.130
So,

15:52.390 --> 15:53.570
we'll head

15:54.530 --> 15:55.370
here.

15:55.860 --> 15:57.260
It's among dense woods,

15:57.740 --> 15:59.060
behind a cliff.

16:00.020 --> 16:01.300
It will be a challenge.

16:02.060 --> 16:03.740
Classic carrot-and-stick tactic.

16:04.420 --> 16:06.460
They lure us with rewards
and then slap us down.

16:07.060 --> 16:08.540
Of course, it's challenging.

16:09.060 --> 16:09.980
Or they can just hold

16:10.340 --> 16:11.500
a martial arts contest.

16:13.540 --> 16:14.380
Let's go.

16:15.860 --> 16:17.860
Cliffs on Mount Baiyue are dangerous.

16:18.220 --> 16:19.180
I doubt anyone

16:19.660 --> 16:21.740
can take this flag.

16:23.540 --> 16:24.660
New recruits can't.

16:25.660 --> 16:26.620
But veterans might

16:27.500 --> 16:29.780
have realized the purpose of the patrol

16:31.260 --> 16:33.140
and completed a thorough mapping.

16:35.420 --> 16:36.260
Do we have

16:36.700 --> 16:37.700
such a talent here?

16:39.500 --> 16:40.340
Yeah.

16:43.340 --> 16:44.180
He Yan.

17:23.109 --> 17:24.740
It's in such a precarious position.

17:24.740 --> 17:26.420
Only you could get that flag, He.

17:27.099 --> 17:27.940
Piece of cake.

17:41.420 --> 17:43.100
He, you're amazing.

17:45.940 --> 17:46.900
With only one patrol,

17:47.380 --> 17:48.220
He Yan

17:48.220 --> 17:50.220
has learned Mount Baiyue by heart.

17:50.660 --> 17:52.060
Impressive new talent.

17:53.300 --> 17:55.140
But I bet on Lei Hou's team.

17:55.780 --> 17:56.660
Everyone

17:57.260 --> 17:59.700
in that team is a top martial artist.

18:00.900 --> 18:02.540
It takes teamwork to capture flags,

18:03.300 --> 18:04.340
not individual heroism.

18:05.260 --> 18:06.700
Therefore, deployment matters

18:07.580 --> 18:08.700
more than muscle.

18:09.380 --> 18:10.620
So I still bet on

18:11.140 --> 18:11.980
He Yan.

18:14.780 --> 18:16.460
H-Hand over your flags.

18:16.660 --> 18:18.300
(The members of He Yan's team are)

18:18.540 --> 18:19.420
(of mixed quality,)

18:20.140 --> 18:21.350
(but each has talents.)

18:21.620 --> 18:23.620
(If he can harness their talents)

18:23.940 --> 18:24.780
(through deployment,)

18:25.100 --> 18:25.940
(they should)

18:26.220 --> 18:27.460
(make quite a team.)

18:27.860 --> 18:28.700
Take action.

18:32.020 --> 18:32.860
Do you surrender?

18:32.860 --> 18:33.700
Y-Yeah.

18:34.140 --> 18:36.220
W-Where are your flags?

18:49.740 --> 18:50.580
Commander.

18:50.780 --> 18:52.540
He Yan's team
set up ambushes and snatched

18:52.540 --> 18:54.180
many flags from the other teams.

18:54.580 --> 18:55.420
"Hold the ground,"

18:56.140 --> 18:57.180
"stay fresh, and strike"

18:58.780 --> 18:59.820
"when the enemy is weak."

19:01.700 --> 19:02.860
Those new recruits

19:03.900 --> 19:05.380
are being thoroughly outplayed.

19:20.260 --> 19:21.100
What a surprise.

19:21.420 --> 19:22.760
You also captured seven flags.

19:23.380 --> 19:24.940
That's impressive.

19:25.940 --> 19:26.820
You flatter me.

19:27.540 --> 19:29.020
Now we each hold seven flags.

19:29.480 --> 19:31.690
Whoever claims
the last one in the valley

19:31.940 --> 19:32.900
becomes the winner.

19:33.580 --> 19:34.940
That terrain is treacherous.

19:35.340 --> 19:36.700
Why don't you retreat

19:37.180 --> 19:38.820
with your team to secure second place?

19:41.100 --> 19:41.940
That may be good,

19:43.540 --> 19:44.780
but I crave first place.

19:46.180 --> 19:48.020
Very well. We'll meet in the valley.

20:17.420 --> 20:19.220
Mr. Lei, this isn't much fun.

20:19.620 --> 20:21.460
Why don't we spice things up?

20:23.060 --> 20:23.900
I'm listening.

20:24.260 --> 20:25.100
What do you want?

20:25.780 --> 20:26.620
A duel.

20:27.020 --> 20:27.860
The loser

20:28.060 --> 20:29.540
surrenders all his flags.

20:31.220 --> 20:32.820
Those guys? Are they up to it?

20:32.820 --> 20:33.780
No way, He.

20:34.500 --> 20:35.980
We worked so hard for these.

20:37.660 --> 20:39.340
It's okay, don't worry.

20:40.460 --> 20:41.500
If we come to duels,

20:42.340 --> 20:43.500
I won't hold back.

20:43.980 --> 20:45.940
You may lose even second place.

20:47.860 --> 20:48.780
I don't like fighting.

20:49.500 --> 20:51.620
But no one can take what I desire

20:52.220 --> 20:53.300
from me.

20:54.220 --> 20:55.060
Therefore,

20:55.340 --> 20:56.420
I'll have to beat you.

21:40.340 --> 21:41.620
He Yan trusts us with his back.

21:42.020 --> 21:44.060
Naturally, we'll eliminate all threats.

21:44.540 --> 21:45.460
You agreed to duel.

21:45.900 --> 21:47.180
But you resorted to tricks?

21:47.900 --> 21:49.500
E-Even bandits...

21:49.900 --> 21:51.140
Bandits keep their word better.

22:07.780 --> 22:09.300
(Odd moves.)

22:30.460 --> 22:32.010
- Nice!
- Well done!

22:34.500 --> 22:35.740
Remarkable, Mr. He.

22:36.220 --> 22:37.100
I concede.

22:38.780 --> 22:39.700
You honor me.

22:41.060 --> 22:41.900
Commander.

22:42.460 --> 22:44.580
He Yan has claimed all 15 flags.

22:45.180 --> 22:46.220
His team has returned.

22:47.100 --> 22:47.940
You've lost.

22:48.300 --> 22:49.260
Commander,

22:49.580 --> 22:51.940
you're a great chess player
and talent scout.

22:53.100 --> 22:53.940
I humbly

22:54.500 --> 22:55.380
admit defeat.

22:57.740 --> 22:59.940
(If she were truly a planted spy here,)

23:00.390 --> 23:02.180
(she wouldn't eagerly draw my attention)

23:02.340 --> 23:04.040
(by flaunting this conquest.)

23:05.300 --> 23:06.860
(But she is no ordinary recruit.)

23:07.700 --> 23:10.220
(He Yan, what's your intention?)

23:11.100 --> 23:11.940
Commander.

23:12.140 --> 23:13.180
The contest concludes.

23:13.500 --> 23:15.100
Shall we proceed with rewards?

23:18.100 --> 23:18.940
No rush.

23:19.460 --> 23:23.340
The Mid-Autumn Festival is
in five days. Wait until then.

23:24.980 --> 23:27.500
Have you decided the one to be

23:28.300 --> 23:30.180
enrolled in the Nine Banners Battalion?

23:56.980 --> 23:58.940
We took first place.

23:58.940 --> 24:00.550
But there's no celebration?

24:01.220 --> 24:02.060
This is lame.

24:02.660 --> 24:03.860
There will be a feast.

24:03.860 --> 24:04.870
It's just postponed.

24:05.260 --> 24:06.100
Rest assured.

24:06.220 --> 24:07.340
You'll get your banquet.

24:08.460 --> 24:09.900
Don't mock me.

24:09.900 --> 24:11.660
Aren't you craving meat?

24:12.100 --> 24:13.320
- Of course, we are.
- Of course, we are.

24:15.580 --> 24:16.420
He,

24:16.860 --> 24:17.700
after you join

24:18.060 --> 24:19.540
the Nine Banners Battalion,

24:20.300 --> 24:21.180
don't forget us.

24:23.020 --> 24:24.140
Never would I.

24:30.140 --> 24:31.820
(Let me ask Xiao Jue about this.)

24:37.540 --> 24:38.380
Morning, Master.

24:43.540 --> 24:44.380
Master.

24:44.500 --> 24:46.020
I lived up to your expectations

24:46.020 --> 24:48.330
and won first place in the competition.

24:48.330 --> 24:49.700
Thanks to your guidance,

24:49.700 --> 24:51.740
I can join the Nine Banners Battalion.

24:52.260 --> 24:55.270
(Great Master and Talented Disciple)
This is a flower basket I made.

24:55.380 --> 24:56.540
These 15 flags

24:56.540 --> 24:58.100
represent my newly earned honors.

24:58.100 --> 24:59.140
Please accept it

24:59.140 --> 25:01.100
as a token of gratitude.

25:04.420 --> 25:05.260
"Talented disciple"?

25:06.380 --> 25:08.780
You really know
how to toot your own horn.

25:08.780 --> 25:10.900
How am I tooting my own horn?

25:11.420 --> 25:13.660
Look, it says "Great Master" right here.

25:14.500 --> 25:15.340
With our bond,

25:15.540 --> 25:17.060
once I join the battalion,

25:17.060 --> 25:18.060
I'll surely

25:18.180 --> 25:19.110
stand by you

25:19.110 --> 25:20.060
through thick and thin

25:20.060 --> 25:21.100
forever.

25:23.220 --> 25:24.260
So eloquent.

25:24.260 --> 25:26.100
It's a pity you're not teaching literacy

25:26.100 --> 25:27.580
to the troops.

25:27.580 --> 25:28.420
Master,

25:29.060 --> 25:31.020
how can you value my silver tongue

25:31.020 --> 25:32.260
over my true capabilities?

25:32.580 --> 25:33.740
With abilities like mine,

25:33.740 --> 25:35.080
I'll become your right-hand man

25:35.220 --> 25:37.620
once I join the Nine Banners Battalion.

25:52.700 --> 25:53.540
Are you really

25:54.940 --> 25:56.340
so eager to join the battalion?

25:56.860 --> 25:57.700
Of course.

25:57.900 --> 25:58.980
I'm a real talent.

25:58.980 --> 26:01.000
It would be your loss if I didn't join

26:01.000 --> 26:02.500
the Nine Banners Battalion.

26:03.580 --> 26:04.980
I won't let you

26:04.980 --> 26:06.060
suffer such a great loss

26:06.060 --> 26:07.380
in your life, Commander.

26:13.820 --> 26:14.660
Commander.

26:14.980 --> 26:16.620
All instructors are waiting for you

26:16.620 --> 26:17.660
at the main tent.

26:21.580 --> 26:23.140
Military affairs take priority.

26:23.140 --> 26:23.980
Go ahead.

26:23.980 --> 26:25.580
We can talk anytime.

26:27.060 --> 26:27.900
Wait.

26:30.260 --> 26:32.100
Take the pastries from the table.

26:41.220 --> 26:42.060
Thank you, Commander.

26:45.590 --> 26:48.940
(General Feihong's Mansion)

26:49.500 --> 26:50.340
General.

26:50.860 --> 26:51.700
There is

26:51.980 --> 26:53.260
no conflict of interest

26:53.260 --> 26:54.100
between us.

26:54.740 --> 26:56.870
Wouldn't it be nice if we both

26:56.870 --> 26:57.860
served the Master?

27:01.060 --> 27:01.940
He wasn't

27:02.340 --> 27:03.700
avoiding you that day.

27:04.220 --> 27:06.220
He's just been burdened with worries

27:06.580 --> 27:08.140
and has become short-tempered.

27:08.900 --> 27:09.860
I wonder what troubles

27:10.380 --> 27:11.580
the Chancellor.

27:20.380 --> 27:21.260
It's Xiao Jue.

27:21.940 --> 27:23.500
He's causing trouble even in Yezhou.

27:23.500 --> 27:25.860
He is drawing attention
with the training

27:25.860 --> 27:27.300
and making outrageous demands

27:27.300 --> 27:29.100
to Yezhou Magistrate Sun Xiangfu

27:29.100 --> 27:30.140
for provisions and funds.

27:30.780 --> 27:32.700
Sun Xiangfu is running short on those,

27:32.700 --> 27:34.140
but Xiao Jue refuses to back down.

27:34.140 --> 27:36.300
They're at an impasse.

27:37.260 --> 27:38.540
As the Chancellor's disciple,

27:39.340 --> 27:41.060
I'm obligated to go to Yezhou Garrison

27:41.460 --> 27:42.420
for mediation.

27:43.020 --> 27:43.860
It's just that

27:44.220 --> 27:46.220
I've never been there.

27:46.860 --> 27:49.180
Besides, I'm merely a scholar.

27:49.700 --> 27:50.740
Unlike you,

27:51.660 --> 27:53.060
who commands numerous talents,

27:53.700 --> 27:56.380
I only have one maid working for me.

28:03.820 --> 28:05.980
My guard here knows some martial arts.

28:06.460 --> 28:08.260
Once you arrive in Yezhou,

28:08.260 --> 28:09.700
you can ask him to run your errands

28:09.700 --> 28:11.100
if you need anything.

28:15.180 --> 28:16.580
That would be most helpful.

28:17.940 --> 28:18.780
But

28:19.460 --> 28:20.380
I can't travel fast.

28:20.940 --> 28:22.140
Perhaps, I'll meet

28:22.740 --> 28:23.580
your guard in Yezhou

28:23.940 --> 28:26.570
so as not to make Magistrate Sun wait.

28:29.220 --> 28:30.060
Alright.

28:31.850 --> 28:34.090
Then I'll take my leave.

28:47.020 --> 28:48.180
Once you reach Yezhou,

28:48.180 --> 28:49.700
go straight to Sun Xiangfu

28:49.700 --> 28:50.580
for cooperation.

28:59.380 --> 29:00.390
General,

29:00.390 --> 29:01.340
won't you

29:02.100 --> 29:03.020
be implicated?

29:03.460 --> 29:04.300
What's the problem?

29:04.300 --> 29:06.820
Yezhou is Sun Xiangfu's territory.

29:06.820 --> 29:08.040
Even if things go south,

29:08.040 --> 29:10.310
Sun Xiangfu is to blame
for his incompetence.

29:10.310 --> 29:12.540
What does it have to do with me?

29:14.740 --> 29:15.580
Chu Zhao wants

29:15.740 --> 29:17.060
to claim credit from Chancellor.

29:17.540 --> 29:19.940
We can't let him steal the spotlight.

29:20.940 --> 29:21.780
So, Ding Yi,

29:22.180 --> 29:23.820
make sure you succeed.

29:24.140 --> 29:25.100
No mistakes are allowed.

29:26.940 --> 29:27.780
Yes.

29:33.140 --> 29:37.000
(Chu Mansion)

29:37.000 --> 29:38.500
(Late Mother, Chu Mingfang)

29:38.500 --> 29:39.340
Mother,

29:40.780 --> 29:41.980
I'm going to Yezhou.

29:43.220 --> 29:44.580
I won't be able to speak

29:45.060 --> 29:46.260
with you for a while.

30:00.580 --> 30:01.420
Young Master.

30:01.740 --> 30:03.620
He Rufei envies
that you're valued by Mr. Xu

30:04.260 --> 30:05.940
and is eager to impress Mr. Xu.

30:06.700 --> 30:08.220
If his men reach Yezhou,

30:08.460 --> 30:09.800
they might ruin everything.

30:10.540 --> 30:11.380
You're mistaken.

30:12.020 --> 30:12.860
They'll help us.

30:13.580 --> 30:15.140
He Rufei's guard is

30:15.140 --> 30:15.980
as skilled as you

30:16.540 --> 30:17.580
in martial arts.

30:18.060 --> 30:19.700
It'll save me much effort

30:20.380 --> 30:21.660
if he takes on Xiao Jue first.

30:22.820 --> 30:24.100
Besides, once he steps in,

30:24.820 --> 30:25.660
whatever happens

30:26.260 --> 30:28.140
won't trace back to Master.

30:28.780 --> 30:30.140
And I can stay in the shadows,

30:30.660 --> 30:33.140
watch them stir things up in Yezhou,

30:33.620 --> 30:34.460
and find a chance

30:35.240 --> 30:37.780
to obtain what Sun Xiangfu holds.

30:43.860 --> 30:44.700
Alright. Thanks.

30:48.340 --> 30:49.180
Try it.

30:49.500 --> 30:50.540
Another veggie dish?

30:50.780 --> 30:52.100
The meat dishes will come.

30:54.860 --> 30:55.700
Here we go.

30:55.700 --> 30:57.380
Let's all eat and drink heartily today.

30:57.540 --> 30:58.380
Happy Mid-Autumn!

30:58.380 --> 30:59.500
- Happy Mid-Autumn!
- Happy Mid-Autumn!

31:05.940 --> 31:07.100
Come on, try this.

31:09.300 --> 31:10.140
He Yan.

31:10.460 --> 31:11.300
He Yan.

31:12.220 --> 31:13.350
Why are you zoning out?

31:13.580 --> 31:14.420
What's out there?

31:15.060 --> 31:16.500
Isn't it the Mid-Autumn banquet?

31:16.500 --> 31:17.700
Where is the Commander?

31:18.540 --> 31:19.720
Huaijin won't come.

31:21.740 --> 31:22.580
Why not?

31:23.300 --> 31:25.300
Since when do you care
so much about him?

31:26.420 --> 31:28.820
Wasn't he supposed to
announce the enrollment

31:28.820 --> 31:30.700
into the Nine Banners Battalion?

31:31.140 --> 31:32.140
If he came,

31:32.540 --> 31:33.580
would you dare

31:33.580 --> 31:35.180
to eat and drink so casually?

31:37.100 --> 31:37.940
That's what I mean.

31:38.300 --> 31:39.380
You're awkward around him.

31:39.660 --> 31:41.340
He's uneasy in such lively places, too.

31:41.420 --> 31:42.260
Why make everyone

31:42.260 --> 31:43.140
uncomfortable?

31:44.900 --> 31:45.740
Come on.

31:45.740 --> 31:46.580
Top performer.

31:46.860 --> 31:47.700
You go first.

31:49.860 --> 31:51.220
Pass them around, guys.

31:51.220 --> 31:52.060
Alright.

31:54.260 --> 31:55.260
(What's mine is mine.)

31:56.260 --> 31:57.610
(I can wait a bit longer.)

31:59.020 --> 31:59.940
(Joining the battalion)

32:00.860 --> 32:03.740
(brings me one step closer
to reclaiming my position.)

32:08.940 --> 32:09.860
Mr. Shen.

32:10.380 --> 32:11.220
Go on.

32:11.300 --> 32:12.140
Dig in.

32:12.300 --> 32:13.140
Don't hold back.

32:13.140 --> 32:14.660
- Sit down.
- Yes.

32:16.220 --> 32:17.060
Come on, dig in.

32:17.340 --> 32:18.180
This is

32:18.340 --> 32:19.660
a Mid-Autumn feast

32:19.660 --> 32:21.700
as well as your celebration banquet.

32:22.820 --> 32:24.540
We're usually not allowed to drink,

32:25.620 --> 32:27.100
but you won first place.

32:27.740 --> 32:28.580
So I

32:28.580 --> 32:30.460
brought this reward for you.

32:32.500 --> 32:33.340
Easy.

32:33.780 --> 32:34.740
Don't be late

32:35.260 --> 32:36.500
for the morning training.

32:37.100 --> 32:38.740
Or you'll face military discipline.

32:39.180 --> 32:40.020
- Yes.
- Yes.

32:40.020 --> 32:40.860
Yes.

32:41.020 --> 32:41.860
Get bowls.

32:41.860 --> 32:42.780
Get bowls. Hurry.

32:45.980 --> 32:46.820
Come on.

32:47.260 --> 32:48.100
Look at you.

32:50.460 --> 32:51.300
Mr. Shen.

32:52.380 --> 32:53.220
Need something?

32:55.700 --> 32:56.540
Mr. Shen.

32:56.980 --> 32:59.100
Are you here to announce the enrollment?

33:02.140 --> 33:02.980
Mr. Shen,

33:02.980 --> 33:04.380
do you have good news

33:04.940 --> 33:05.780
for us?

33:06.700 --> 33:07.540
Yeah, Mr. Shen.

33:07.620 --> 33:09.300
Stop keeping us in suspense.

33:09.580 --> 33:10.420
Yeah.

33:13.260 --> 33:14.100
Yeah.

33:14.380 --> 33:16.140
After I'm done here,

33:16.740 --> 33:17.660
I'll offer Lei Hou

33:18.060 --> 33:18.900
my congratulations.

33:21.620 --> 33:22.460
Lei Hou?

33:22.460 --> 33:23.300
Lei Hou?

33:24.140 --> 33:24.980
Not He Yan?

33:25.300 --> 33:26.220
Wait, Mr. Shen.

33:26.340 --> 33:27.460
But He took first place...

33:27.780 --> 33:29.340
So what?

33:31.380 --> 33:32.220
Get back to it.

33:32.460 --> 33:33.300
Don't make a scene.

33:34.860 --> 33:35.780
Listen up.

33:36.380 --> 33:37.700
Commander selected soldiers

33:38.180 --> 33:40.220
based on a comprehensive evaluation.

33:40.980 --> 33:43.420
The contest was just one aspect.

33:45.780 --> 33:46.620
He Yan.

33:47.540 --> 33:48.380
Stay sharp.

33:48.660 --> 33:49.820
You've got real potential.

33:50.140 --> 33:51.700
You'll have many more chances.

34:04.230 --> 34:06.390
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

34:06.490 --> 34:10.409
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

34:10.590 --> 34:12.530
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

34:12.630 --> 34:17.550
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

34:29.650 --> 34:31.060
♪I've seen the mountains♪

34:31.260 --> 34:32.670
♪And trodden through ice♪

34:32.940 --> 34:35.750
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

34:36.060 --> 34:37.449
♪Destiny is my creed♪

34:37.510 --> 34:38.909
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

34:39.060 --> 34:40.850
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

34:42.060 --> 34:43.530
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

34:43.690 --> 34:44.980
♪Gazing through the mire♪

34:45.159 --> 34:47.550
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

34:47.750 --> 34:49.800
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

34:50.929 --> 34:52.770
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

34:54.719 --> 34:57.640
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

34:57.730 --> 35:00.390
♪There must always be a longing♪

35:00.850 --> 35:05.910
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

35:06.240 --> 35:08.250
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

35:08.570 --> 35:12.210
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

35:12.450 --> 35:14.340
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

35:14.370 --> 35:18.220
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

35:18.570 --> 35:20.510
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

35:20.690 --> 35:24.520
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

35:24.770 --> 35:30.530
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

35:31.410 --> 35:36.880
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

